# faces.kit -- the parts a face is made from, KEY=choices (one space
# between). ASCII only: the console draws them. spark awaken lets the
# model pick the eyes and the mouth; the body comes from the machine's
# name, so two machines rarely look alike. Each mood is the same face:
#   idle (o.o)  blink (-.-)  asleep (-.-)z  waking (-o-)  thinking (o.O)
#   pleased (^.^)  puzzled (o.?)  alarmed (O.O)  glance (.o.)
#   listening (o.o)~
EYES=o * u
MOUTH=. _ - v
BODY=() [] {} <> ||
